begin="1:17.364" end="1:18.609">打我妈</span><span begin="1:18.609" end="1:20.812">妈</span></p><p begin="1:22.114" end="1:26.494" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.114" end="1:22.920">我说</span><span begin="1:22.920" end="1:23.661">的话</span> <span begin="1:23.661" end="1:24.839">你甘会</span><span begin="1:24.839" end="1:26.494">听</span></p><p begin="1:28.392" end="1:33.474" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.392" end="1:28.848">不要</span><span begin="1:28.848" end="1:29.283">再</span><span begin="1:29.283" end="1:30.026">这样</span><span begin="1:30.026" end="1:31.271">打我妈</span><span begin="1:31.271" end="1:33.474">妈</span></p><p begin="1:34.718" end="1:39.422" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.718" end="1:35.474">难道</span><span begin="1:35.474" end="1:36.319">你手</span><span begin="1:36.319" end="1:37.503">不会痛</span><span begin="1:37.503" end="1:39.422">吗</span></p></div><div begin="2:05.963" end="2:30.562"><p begin="2:05.963" end="2:08.696" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.963" end="2:06.359">其实</span><span begin="2:06.359" end="2:06.598">我</span><span begin="2:06.598" end="2:06.953">回家</span><span begin="2:06.953" end="2:07.517">就想要</span><span begin="2:07.517" end="2:07.983">阻止</span><span begin="2:08.063" end="2:08.696">一切</span></p><p begin="2:08.706" end="2:11.764" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.706" end="2:09.289">让家庭</span><span begin="2:09.289" end="2:10.198">回到过去 甜甜</span><span begin="2:10.198" end="2:11.200">温馨的欢乐</span><span begin="2:11.200" end="2:11.764">香味</span></p><p begin="2:12.086" end="2:15.616" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.086" end="2:12.449">虽然</span><span begin="2:12.449" end="2:12.786">这是</span><span begin="2:12.786" end="2:13.078">我</span><span begin="2:13.078" end="2:13.401">编造出</span><span begin="2:13.401" end="2:14.246">来的事实</span> <span begin="2:14.401" end="2:15.030">有点讽刺</span> <span begin="2:15.030" end="2:15.616">有点酸性</span></p><p begin="2:15.626" end="2:18.455" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.626" end="2:16.589">但它却在这</span><span begin="2:16.589" end="2:17.190">快乐社会</span><span begin="2:17.190" end="2:17.925">发生产生</span><span begin="2:17.925" end="2:18.455">共鸣</span></p><p begin="2:18.372" end="2:22.373" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.372" end="2:19.107">产生共鸣</span><span begin="2:19.107" end="2:19.777">来阻止</span><span begin="2:19.777" end="2:20.292">一切暴力</span> <span begin="2:20.292" end="2:20.901">眼泪随着</span><span begin="2:20.901" end="2:21.289">音符</span><span begin="2:21.289" end="2:21.974">吸入血液</span><span begin="2:21.974" end="2:22.373">情绪</span></p><p begin="2:22.383" end="2:25.272" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.383" end="2:22.760">从</span><span begin="2:22.760" end="2:23.319">小到大</span><span begin="2:23.319" end="2:23.563">你</span><span begin="2:23.563" end="2:23.791">叫我</span><span begin="2:23.791" end="2:24.084">学习</span><span begin="2:24.084" end="2:24.344">你</span> <span begin="2:24.344" end="2:24.823">把你当榜</span><span begin="2:24.823" end="2:25.272">样</span></p><p begin="2:25.161" end="2:28.455" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.161" end="2:25.615">好多的</span><span begin="2:25.615" end="2:26.069">假象</span> <span begin="2:26.092" end="2:26.828">妈妈常说</span> <span begin="2:26.994" end="2:27.439">乖</span> <span begin="2:27.511" end="2:27.979">听你爸的</span><span begin="2:27.979" end="2:28.455">话</span></p><p begin="2:28.475" end="2:30.562" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.475" end="2:29.096">你叫我</span><span begin="2:29.238" end="2:29.986">怎么跟你</span><span begin="2:29.986" end="2:30.562">像</span></p></div><div begin="2:31.180" end="2:32.183"><p begin="2:31.180" end="2:32.183" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.180" end="2:31.289">你</span><span begin="2:31.289" end="2:31.498">走</span><span begin="2:31.498" end="2:32.183">开</span></p></div><div begin="2:32.383" end="2:56.021"><p begin="2:32.383" e